   "ocr": "Figure 2. Cortical activation related to genuine acupuncture and pseudo-stimulation. The genuine stimulation produced significant activation of the insula, operculum, SMA, SI, SII, SMG, PPC, ACC and fusiform areas, whereas the anterior insula, SMA, SMG, PPC, ACC, fusiform area and precuneus were activated in response to pseudo-stimulation. Significant decreases in the DMN, including the vmPFC, PCC, IPL, MTG and parahippocampus, were observed in both conditions."
  },
